@startuml assembly-order-states
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
left to right direction

state "Created" as Created
state "Assembled" as Assembled : car reserved /\ncomponents confirmed
state "Failed" as Failed : reason recorded
state "Canceled" as Canceled

[*] --> Created : OrderSentForApprovalEvent
Created --> Assembled : check passed\n→ APPROVED
Created --> Failed : check failed\n→ REJECTED
Assembled --> Canceled : OrderCanceledEvent\n(reserved car released)
Failed --> Canceled : OrderCanceledEvent
[*] -[norank]-> Canceled : OrderCanceledEvent\narrived first
Canceled --> [*]
@enduml
